WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.240
Meet FlowSight, created by Manuel Castillejo.

2
00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:04.240
Here is the complete app in ninety seconds.

3
00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:07.170
Name your task, set a daily goal,

4
00:00:07.170 --> 00:00:09.450
and start tracking. Choose a normal timer

5
00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:12.050
or Pomodoro, with adjustable work and break intervals.

6
00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:14.960
Describe your tasks and available time.

7
00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:16.900
Local AI proposes a session.

8
00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:19.280
Adjust the blocks, then confirm before adding

9
00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:20.140
them to your schedule.

10
00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:22.960
Total Focus protects a timed block.

11
00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:25.420
Pair the browser extension, choose blocked sites

12
00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:28.000
and exceptions, and optionally quiet system notifications.

13
00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:31.580
Insights shows recorded time, categories, your activity

14
00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:33.660
timeline, sustained focus and browsing patterns.

15
00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:36.280
Local analysis supplies context; you review what it means.

16
00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:39.300
Generate a work report, review the summary,

17
00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:40.480
and export a PDF.

18
00:00:40.980 --> 00:00:43.260
Schedule weekly saves, then record decisions and

19
00:00:43.260 --> 00:00:44.160
a date to review them.

20
00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:47.530
Optional Cloud adds Coach conversations, selected team

21
00:00:47.530 --> 00:00:49.530
summaries, and Google or Microsoft calendars.

22
00:00:49.730 --> 00:00:52.230
Review permissions; these features need an eligible plan.

23
00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:54.640
Link Jira or Linear tasks with an

24
00:00:54.640 --> 00:00:57.140
eligible plan. Calendar recaps need a configured

25
00:00:57.140 --> 00:01:00.160
connection. Notion publishing is unavailable in this release.

26
00:01:01.290 --> 00:01:03.910
Manage tasks, local calendar blocks, drafts, browser

27
00:01:03.910 --> 00:01:05.930
tools and preferences. Confirm changes.

28
00:01:06.110 --> 00:01:08.290
Connect external AI through the read-only MCP server.

29
00:01:09.260 --> 00:01:11.160
Control sync, cloud AI and analytics separately.

30
00:01:11.540 --> 00:01:13.440
Exclude applications, choose retention, and export or

31
00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:15.480
erase data. External AI can receive report

32
00:01:15.480 --> 00:01:16.330
data you request.

33
00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:18.680
Join private friend leagues for weekly focus

34
00:01:18.680 --> 00:01:20.460
points, without sharing work details.

35
00:01:20.900 --> 00:01:23.140
Set startup, tray, language and theme preferences,

36
00:01:23.180 --> 00:01:24.200
and check for updates.

37
00:01:25.190 --> 00:01:27.070
Explore FlowSight at flowsight dot site.

38
00:01:27.070 --> 00:01:29.170
Built by Manuel Castillejo.
